    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A rare opportunity to acquire an impressive and exceptionally spacious seven-bedroom detached residence, privately positioned within Barrowlands, an exclusive development of just six detached homes on Leighlin Road, Carlow. Extending to approximately 2,790 sq. ft., this substantial family residence offers an exceptional level of accommodation, combining generous proportions, stylish living spaces and remarkable versatility, all within a short walk of Carlow town centre.\n\nFrom the moment of arrival, the scale of the property is evident, with double gates opening onto a generous cobblelock forecourt. The welcoming reception hall leads to a large dual-aspect sitting room, while the second reception room flows effortlessly through an archway into a contemporary gloss-finish kitchen and adjoining dining area. A separate utility room adds further convenience. Three bedrooms and two bathrooms complete the ground floor, providing excellent flexibility for family living, guests or those seeking generous accommodation on one level.\n\nThe first floor is equally impressive, comprising four further bedrooms, each with its own ensuite, while the exceptionally well-appointed master bedroom enjoys the added luxury of two walk-in wardrobes.\n\nOutside, the property continues to impress, with private gardens to both front and rear, a spacious patio area and detached garage providing valuable additional storage.\n\nCombining an enviable town location with outstanding proportions and seven-bedroom accommodation, this is a distinctive and highly versatile home offering an exceptional standard of family living.\n\nOutside \nGardens to front & rear. \nCobblelock forecourt with double gate entrance\nDetached Garage\nPatio area\nMature shrubs and hedging \n\nServices \nAll Mains \nNGCH"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Reception Hall (27.36ft x 11.35ft) with laminate wood flooring. Under stairs storage. Walk-in airing cupboard. Recessed ceiling lighting. <br>Sitting Room (21.78ft x 22.31ft) with wood flooring. Dual aspect. Wall mounted fire. French doors to side. <br>Living Room (20.37ft x 10.40ft) with laminate wood flooring. Solid fuel stove (2 door) with feature stone surround. Wood panelling to ceiling. Arch to kitchen. <br>Kitchen/Dining Area (14.83ft x 11.15ft) Modern fitted gloss finish kitchen with double oven and integrated microwave, larder press and breakfast counter. Tiling to floor and around work counter. \n\nDining area - c. 4.61m x 3.22m with tiled floor. French doors to side. <br>Utility Room (10.27ft x 8.27ft) with gloss finish presses. Airing cupboard. Plumbed for appliances. <br>Bedroom 1 (11.65ft x 11.32ft) with wood flooring. Six door fitted wardrobe with five drawer fitted chest of drawers. <br>Bathroom 1 (6.92ft x 5.77ft) Fully tiled with w.c., w.h.b. vanity and bath, electric shower fitted over bath. <br>Bedroom 2 (12.50ft x 10.17ft) with wood flooring.<br>Bedroom 3 (13.68ft x 12.07ft) with wood flooring. Four door fitted wardrobe. <br>Bathroom 2 (6.86ft x 6.20ft) Fully tiled with w.c., glass mounted basin and pedestal., jacuzzi bath. <br>Landing (7.22ft x 6.99ft) with wood flooring. <br>Bedroom 4 (14.73ft x 10.79ft) with wood flooring. Two walk-in wardrobes with hanging space and shelving. Ensuite. French doors onto roof area. <br>En-suite (7.91ft x 4.07ft) Fully tiled with w.c., w.h.b. & shower. Velux window. <br>Bedroom 5 (13.98ft x 11.35ft) with wood flooring. Ensuite. <br>En-suite (7.74ft x 4.10ft) Fully tiled with w.c., w.h.b. & shower. <br>Bedroom 6 (12.63ft x 10.43ft) with wood flooring. Ensuite. <br>En-suite (9.25ft x 4.79ft) with w.c., w.h.b. & shower. Linoleum flooring. <br>Bedroom 7 (13.32ft x 8.20ft) with wood flooring. Ensuite. <br>En-suite (6.89ft x 4.23ft) with w.c., w.h.b. & shower. "
